[{"_1":2},"routes/llms.txt",{"_3":4},"data","# Relationship Goals\n\n> Thoughtful gift, date and couple style inspiration for couples.\n\n## Pages\n- [Guides](https://relationshipgoals.store/guides): Every couple guide, newest first.\n- [Couples Halloween Costumes: 14 Easy Last-Minute Ideas (2026)](https://relationshipgoals.store/guides/couples-halloween-costumes): 14 easy couples Halloween costumes for 2026: funny pairs, cozy onesies and 5-minute last-minute ideas you can still get before Halloween.\n- [Boo Basket for Boyfriend: 12 Spooky Gift Ideas He Will Love](https://relationshipgoals.store/guides/boo-basket-for-boyfriend): How to make a boo basket for your boyfriend: 12 Halloween gift ideas he will love, from horror movie games and spooky socks to snacks and a cozy blanket.\n- [Halloween Date Night Ideas: 10 Spooky Things to Do Together](https://relationshipgoals.store/guides/halloween-date-night-ideas): 10 Halloween date night ideas for couples at home: pumpkin carving, a horror movie night, a haunted escape room game, spooky cocktails and more.\n- [Christmas Gifts for Boyfriend: 25 Ideas He Will Actually Use](https://relationshipgoals.store/guides/christmas-gifts-for-boyfriend): Stuck on what to get your boyfriend for Christmas? 25 gifts he will actually use, from sentimental keepsakes to cozy upgrades, each loved by thousands of buyers.\n- [Matching Couple Outfits: 25 Ideas That Look Coordinated, Not Cheesy](https://relationshipgoals.store/guides/matching-couple-outfits-ideas): 25 matching couple outfit ideas for every season and date, from cozy hoodies to 2026 trends. Look like a pair without dressing like twins.\n- [Matching Christmas Pajamas for Couples: 11 Cozy Sets for 2026](https://relationshipgoals.store/guides/matching-christmas-pajamas-couples-2026): The cutest matching Christmas pajamas for couples: plaid flannel, Fair Isle, fleece onesies and more, plus sizing tips so both sets fit.\n- [How to Coordinate Outfits With Your Partner (Without Matching)](https://relationshipgoals.store/guides/coordinate-outfits-without-matching): Learn how to coordinate outfits with your partner in 5 simple rules, with color pairs and 3 ready-made looks. Look like a pair, not twins.\n- [Best Long Distance Relationship Gifts](https://relationshipgoals.store/guides/best-long-distance-relationship-gifts): The best long distance relationship gifts: touch bracelets, touch lamps, open-when letters and keepsakes that help you feel close across the miles.\n- [Gifts for the Man Who Has Everything: 12 Ideas He Does Not Own Yet](https://relationshipgoals.store/guides/gifts-for-the-man-who-has-everything): Shopping for the man who has everything? 12 unique gifts he does not own yet: clever gadgets, experiences in a box and luxe upgrades, all loved by real buyers.\n- [Sentimental Gifts for Him: 13 Ideas That Will Make Him Emotional](https://relationshipgoals.store/guides/sentimental-gifts-for-him): 13 sentimental gifts for your boyfriend or husband: love notes, keepsakes, engraved pieces he carries every day and memory journals that will make him emotional.\n- [Long Distance Gifts for Boyfriend: 12 Ideas to Feel Close From Miles Away](https://relationshipgoals.store/guides/long-distance-gifts-for-boyfriend): 12 long distance gifts for your boyfriend: touch bracelets, love note messengers, care packages and video date games that make the miles feel smaller.\n- [About](https://relationshipgoals.store/about): Who we are and how we work.\n- [Contact](https://relationshipgoals.store/contact): Send us a message."]
